  "conclusion": "GLTF float colors undergo deliberate SRGBToLinear compensation before static builder ToFColor(true). In-range source colors therefore retain intended numeric linear attribute up to 8-bit quantization. Above1 values cannot survive FColor normalized 8-bit; ToFColorSRGB documents positive out-of-range ->255. This is a real possible loss, not proof of primary current crop cause.",
